{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A sorted set kept in a red–black tree: a binary search tree whose vertices are red or black,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no red vertex under a red one and the same number of black vertices on every path from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"root down (Guibas and Sedgewick, 1978)."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/init()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/init(_:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/height"]},{"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/contains(_:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/elements(in:)-37c2j","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/elements(in:)-6yum3","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/lowerBound(_:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/max()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/min()","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/remove(at:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/remove(checkedAt:)","doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlackTree\/upperBound(_:)"]},{"title":"Subscripts","generated":true,"anchor":"Subscripts","identifiers":["doc:\/\/BinarySearchTrees\/documentation\/BinarySearchTrees\/RedBlac